6. Error Catalog

Create a centralized error catalog.

Example:

public sealed record ErrorDefinition(
    string Code,
    string Description,
    string Category,
    string Severity,
    string RootCauseHint,
    string Impact,
    string RecommendedAction);

Example definition:

Code:
MQ-001
Description:
Reservation request publication failed.
Category:
INTEGRATION
Severity:
ERROR
RootCauseHint:
IBM MQ endpoint unavailable or connection timed out.
Impact:
Reservation request remains pending.
RecommendedAction:
Verify MQ connectivity and queue availability.
Allow configured retry policy to execute.
Escalate if retry threshold is exceeded.

