7. Error Catalog Fields

Every predefined error must contain:

Field	Purpose
ErrorCode	Stable machine-readable identifier
Title	Short operational description
Category	Functional/DB/MQ/etc.
Severity	INFO/WARN/ERROR/CRITICAL
Source	Component that detected the issue
Target	Dependency affected
RootCauseHint	Likely cause
Impact	Business/technical impact
Action	Immediate remediation
FocusArea	Where engineers should investigate
Retryable	Whether retry is allowed
RecoveryStrategy	How recovery occurs
Alertable	Whether alert should be generated
Documentation	Link/reference to troubleshooting guidance

