15. Severity

Use a controlled severity model.

INFO

Expected operational event.

WARN

Unexpected condition that does not currently prevent successful processing.

ERROR

Operation failed but recovery may be possible.

CRITICAL

Business processing or system availability is seriously compromised and requires immediate attention.

Do not log normal retry attempts as CRITICAL.

