Implement centralized exception handling.

For ASP.NET Core:

Request
 ↓
Middleware
 ↓
Controller
 ↓
Application Service
 ↓
Domain

Unhandled exceptions should ultimately be translated into a standardized error response.

For BackgroundService:

Worker
 ↓
Operation
 ↓
Exception Handler
 ↓
Structured Log
 ↓
